# Huo — Creative Network (Ohio / Columbus)

Local creative network: portfolios, gigs, collaboration, and hiring — Instagram feed +
Fiverr marketplace + LinkedIn networking, built for real-world Columbus/Ohio community
(not clout).

**Read before product, brand, scope, or data-model decisions:**

1. `docs/PRODUCT-BIBLE.md` — authoritative product bible (brand, MVP, pricing, GTM)
2. `docs/FOUNDATION.md` — condensed working summary
3. `docs/GOOGLE-STUDIO-UI-PROMPT.md` — UI-only Studio prompt

Prefer the Product Bible when older Google Doc / Milanote notes disagree.

## Quick context

Three account types: Creative (supply), Business (demand), Community/consumer (audience).

Bottom nav: Home · Search · Create (+) · Messages · Profile.

Brand: pink `#FF3C75`, black `#000000`, grey `#888888`; Courier New + Impact (sparse);
editorial / BTS photography. Reputation over popularity (no follower-count theater).

Pricing (public): Creative Pro $9.99/mo or $99/yr · Business Pro $19.99/mo or $199.99/yr ·
Founding lock-in $4.99/mo for first 200 · Consumer free.

Launch: Columbus beta → Ohio expansion → city-based national model.

Local Milanote screenshots and wireframes: `Design Reference/`.

